WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.160
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.240 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:48.640 --> 01:50.440
- So beautiful.
- Fairy.

01:50.520 --> 01:51.920
Look how beautiful this fabric is.

01:52.000 --> 01:53.160
- It suits you.
- I want this.

01:53.720 --> 01:54.800
Take her measurements.

01:55.400 --> 01:57.040
The fabric for the wedding dress is ready.

01:57.720 --> 02:00.480
The wedding is coming.
Only the Phoenix Crown is not ready.

02:00.560 --> 02:02.480
- Have you prepared it?
- The Phoenix Crown?

02:02.560 --> 02:04.200
Actually, everything for the wedding

02:04.280 --> 02:06.600
are prepared by the Silent Moon Palace.

02:06.680 --> 02:08.320
Only the Phoenix Crown for the Moon Queen

02:08.400 --> 02:10.120
needs to be prepared by yourself.

02:10.199 --> 02:11.680
I should prepare it myself?

02:11.760 --> 02:12.680
Yes.

02:13.240 --> 02:15.480
The previous Moon Queens all came
from well-known families

02:15.560 --> 02:16.760
of Cangyan Sea.

02:17.400 --> 02:20.440
The Phoenix Crown worn on their wedding
represents their families.

02:20.520 --> 02:22.360
What do you mean?

02:23.160 --> 02:24.440
Are you looking down on orphans

02:24.520 --> 02:26.240
or on the new Moon Queen's
family background?

02:26.320 --> 02:29.120
- Please forgive us. We didn't mean that.
- Please forgive us. We didn't mean that.

02:29.920 --> 02:31.960
Jieli. Don't get mad.

02:32.040 --> 02:33.400
They're just answering questions.

02:33.480 --> 02:34.400
Stand up, please.

02:35.760 --> 02:36.680
Sit down.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.640
Phoenix Crown?

02:47.040 --> 02:49.360
No problem.
I can prepare the Phoenix Crown myself.

02:49.440 --> 02:50.480
How?

02:51.280 --> 02:54.400
I don't have such a valuable thing
in my treasure collection.

02:55.320 --> 02:56.520
I've made up my mind.

02:57.040 --> 02:58.840
I can weave the Phoenix Crown

02:58.920 --> 03:01.280
with fresh flowers and tender grass.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.920
It doesn't cost much and it's beautiful.

03:03.000 --> 03:04.600
It won't be worse than the previous ones.

03:04.680 --> 03:06.800
- What do you think?
- It's too ordinary.

03:06.880 --> 03:08.320
Don't you feel embarrassed?

03:08.400 --> 03:10.400
How can it be embarrassing?

03:12.240 --> 03:15.040
Do you remember the flowers in my garden?

03:15.800 --> 03:18.720
Back then,
when I first came to Cangyan Sea,

03:18.800 --> 03:21.080
Big Blockhead built
the Arbiter Hall for me

03:21.840 --> 03:23.920
and planted those flowers for me.

03:24.600 --> 03:27.320
The flowers will bloom in a few days.

03:27.400 --> 03:30.040
I'll make the best Phoenix Crown
with them.

03:34.520 --> 03:37.040
Fairy, you really don't know

03:37.120 --> 03:38.680
your own origin?

03:39.360 --> 03:40.520
No.

03:40.600 --> 03:42.640
But it doesn't matter anymore.

03:43.480 --> 03:45.720
I don't want to know who I was before.

03:46.320 --> 03:48.200
I only know that from now on,

03:48.280 --> 03:50.440
I'll be Dongfang Qingcang's wife.

03:51.120 --> 03:52.240
Yes.

03:52.320 --> 03:54.360
The Moon Queen of Cangyan Sea

03:54.440 --> 03:56.640
is much more distinguished
than those aristocrats.

03:57.360 --> 04:00.480
Speaking of which,
you should urge the lord.

04:00.560 --> 04:02.080
He has been busy recently.

04:02.160 --> 04:03.880
We've been trying to take his measurements

04:03.960 --> 04:05.560
and make the wedding clothes for him,

04:05.640 --> 04:07.120
but we didn't see him.

04:14.040 --> 04:16.440
By the way,
please take Jieli's measurements.

04:16.519 --> 04:19.160
She's getting married soon.
Make her a wedding dress too.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.480
- Yes.
- No.

04:21.519 --> 04:23.480
Why not? We are best friends.

04:23.560 --> 04:25.640
We should share weal and woe.

04:25.720 --> 04:27.400
- Hurry up.
- I really don't want it.

04:29.200 --> 04:31.280
I said I don't want it.

04:33.760 --> 04:34.680
Jieli.

04:39.760 --> 04:40.600
Jieli.

04:42.840 --> 04:44.520
Jieli.

04:44.600 --> 04:46.080
Jieli, what's wrong?

04:46.160 --> 04:48.120
Orchid, stop being so nice to me.

04:48.920 --> 04:51.200
I'm not a good friend at all.

04:51.280 --> 04:52.960
I pretended to be close to you

04:53.040 --> 04:55.120
because I wanted to cheat you
into buying my medicine.

04:55.680 --> 04:57.560
Actually, your immortal root
can't be cured.

04:58.400 --> 04:59.760
You're stupid.

04:59.840 --> 05:00.840
You always trust me.

05:03.080 --> 05:05.720
You scared me to death.
Just because of this?

05:05.800 --> 05:07.760
This is already an old story.

05:07.840 --> 05:10.000
Besides, it's good that you lied to me.

05:10.600 --> 05:12.480
Everyone said my immortal root

05:12.560 --> 05:14.040
couldn't be cured.

05:14.120 --> 05:15.480
Only you said there was hope.

05:16.200 --> 05:18.320
Hearing that, I felt more relieved

05:18.400 --> 05:19.720
since there was hope.

05:20.320 --> 05:22.200
I was willingly deceived by you.

05:23.800 --> 05:25.800
You're the biggest fool
within the three realms!

05:26.760 --> 05:28.040
So is Shangque.

05:28.840 --> 05:31.520
Between Shangque and I,
who is more stupid?

05:32.200 --> 05:33.360
You're both equally stupid.

05:37.040 --> 05:38.200
Smile.

05:54.920 --> 05:55.880
Don't move.

05:56.640 --> 05:57.560
Lift your arms.

06:07.920 --> 06:08.960
You've lost weight.

06:09.880 --> 06:11.840
Your back is not as straight as before.

06:12.720 --> 06:14.520
Have you been tired recently?

06:14.600 --> 06:15.880
I promised you

06:16.920 --> 06:18.000
I wouldn't lie to you again.

06:24.040 --> 06:25.120
The war is coming.

06:28.160 --> 06:31.200
This time, it is the greatest war
between the Moon and Fairy Tribes.

06:32.840 --> 06:35.080
If we can't stop them in Xuanxu Realm,

06:35.680 --> 06:39.080
they can head straight into the Ninth You.

06:39.640 --> 06:41.800
Now the number of the Moon Tribe

06:42.320 --> 06:43.400
is only 80,000.

06:44.680 --> 06:45.680
Besides,

06:47.520 --> 06:49.320
I have lost the Hellfire.

06:55.080 --> 06:56.600
How many days do we have until the war?

06:58.240 --> 06:59.200
Three to five days.

07:02.160 --> 07:03.360
That's enough.

07:04.520 --> 07:05.480
What?

07:06.680 --> 07:07.760
Enough time to marry me.

07:09.200 --> 07:12.000
Didn't you set the wedding date
ten days after that day?

07:12.080 --> 07:13.680
That's three days from now.

07:14.320 --> 07:15.200
Orchid.

07:17.680 --> 07:20.040
Changheng has been pardoned
by Lord Yunzhong

07:20.520 --> 07:21.880
and restored as the God of War.

07:25.280 --> 07:26.480
We can keep our wedding

07:27.120 --> 07:28.520
as simple as possible.

07:29.360 --> 07:30.800
No need to be extravagant.

07:30.880 --> 07:32.080
No need to invite guests.

07:33.280 --> 07:35.280
Let's have the simplest feast

07:36.280 --> 07:38.600
and ask Shangque and Jieli

07:38.680 --> 07:40.200
to be our witnesses.

07:40.280 --> 07:41.880
You're not a member of the Moon Tribe.

07:41.960 --> 07:43.160
You don't have to stay here.

07:44.960 --> 07:47.960
But you have to make
a new wedding outfit anyway.

07:48.800 --> 07:50.960
Otherwise, it's not proper.

07:52.120 --> 07:53.040
Orchid.

08:11.480 --> 08:13.120
Besides no lies to me,

08:16.280 --> 08:18.600
do you remember what else you promised me?

08:22.600 --> 08:23.640
Have you forgotten?

08:24.320 --> 08:25.160
I haven't.

08:34.480 --> 08:35.919
No matter what happens,

08:38.960 --> 08:40.280
we have to face it together.

08:58.000 --> 08:59.280
In two days,

09:01.080 --> 09:02.680
I'll be your wife.

09:07.240 --> 09:09.080
Cangyan Sea is my home.

09:11.200 --> 09:12.560
I'm not going anywhere.

10:17.960 --> 10:19.320
Why did you do this to me?

10:22.640 --> 10:23.560
Big Blockhead.

10:25.680 --> 10:26.520
Big Blockhead.

10:29.720 --> 10:31.080
Why did you do this to me?

10:33.880 --> 10:35.320
Why did you do this to me?

10:36.960 --> 10:38.560
Why did you do this to me?

10:42.080 --> 10:43.280
Don't go.

10:44.280 --> 10:45.200
Don't go.

10:45.720 --> 10:46.640
Don't go.

10:46.720 --> 10:48.280
- Why did you do this to me?
- I'm going to kill you.

10:49.400 --> 10:50.320
I'm going to kill you.

10:51.080 --> 10:52.440
- Why did you do this to me?
- Why did you lie to me?

10:52.520 --> 10:54.320
- You said I am the one you love most.
- Don't go.

10:54.400 --> 10:56.840
- Why her?
- Don't abandon me.

10:56.920 --> 10:58.120
Don't go.

10:58.200 --> 10:59.480
Don't leave me alone.

11:01.200 --> 11:02.520
Don't go.

11:05.360 --> 11:07.160
Why did you lie to me?

11:08.680 --> 11:10.320
Why did you lie to me?

11:11.600 --> 11:13.640
I'm begging you. Please don't go.

11:14.440 --> 11:16.120
Don't go.

11:18.560 --> 11:21.240
- I'm begging you. Please don't go.
- Why?

11:21.320 --> 11:22.760
No. Don't go.

11:22.840 --> 11:24.360
Lady Wanqing.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.400
You are still alive.

11:26.320 --> 11:27.400
I'm going to kill you.

11:28.800 --> 11:29.760
I'm going to kill you.

11:30.320 --> 11:31.280
Lady Wanqing.

11:31.840 --> 11:33.000
Who are they?

11:34.120 --> 11:35.040
They are me.

11:35.760 --> 11:37.240
But they are also not me.

11:37.320 --> 11:38.640
They and I

11:38.720 --> 11:40.400
are just memories from one of my lives.

11:41.640 --> 11:43.040
Why did you do this to me?

11:43.120 --> 11:44.360
What do you mean?

11:45.360 --> 11:46.760
There's no time to explain.

11:47.480 --> 11:50.000
In this place,
I can only stay sober for a moment.

11:51.480 --> 11:53.400
Run! Don't get swallowed by them.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.240
Remember,

11:55.320 --> 11:57.880
the loss of your life is the gain of mine.

11:58.680 --> 12:00.160
If I can come back to life,

12:00.240 --> 12:01.360
you will die.

12:02.200 --> 12:03.840
All the secrets are…

12:05.040 --> 12:06.240
Why her?

12:06.320 --> 12:07.360
Lady Wanqing.

12:07.440 --> 12:08.520
Lady Wanqing!

12:10.600 --> 12:11.680
Big Blockhead.

12:11.760 --> 12:12.880
Big Blockhead. Help me!

12:13.360 --> 12:14.360
Big Blockhead!

12:14.440 --> 12:15.680
Big Blockhead! Where are you?

12:17.120 --> 12:18.000
Big Blockhead!

12:19.920 --> 12:21.120
Help me!

12:22.760 --> 12:24.560
- I'm here.
- Big Blockhead.

12:24.640 --> 12:25.720
- Big Blockhead.
- It's okay.

12:51.720 --> 12:53.040
Dongfang Qingcang.

12:53.120 --> 12:54.000
Who's there?

12:58.000 --> 13:00.000
You're finally here.

13:00.080 --> 13:01.400
What is this place?

13:02.240 --> 13:04.720
This is the most secretive

13:04.800 --> 13:06.480
and darkest corner of your heart.

13:07.040 --> 13:08.280
And I am

13:08.360 --> 13:10.760
the owner of this place.

13:15.760 --> 13:16.880
You're playing tricks.

13:16.960 --> 13:18.640
This is just an illusion.

13:18.720 --> 13:20.600
I'll break the spell

13:20.680 --> 13:22.280
and find out your real body.

13:33.320 --> 13:34.800
You can't kill me.

13:35.280 --> 13:38.040
If you can still manipulate the Hellfire,

13:38.120 --> 13:40.520
you might be able to dispel the evil qi

13:40.600 --> 13:42.240
and escape from here.

13:42.320 --> 13:44.560
But now,

13:44.640 --> 13:47.080
you can't do anything.

13:47.160 --> 13:48.320
You are too weak

13:49.200 --> 13:50.840
to trick me.

13:52.760 --> 13:54.360
Then,

13:54.440 --> 13:57.160
why didn't you tell her
about the Bone Orchid?

13:58.240 --> 14:00.000
Shut up!

14:11.760 --> 14:13.840
You are too angry.

14:14.480 --> 14:18.240
People with choices won't be so angry.

14:18.720 --> 14:20.160
You must be

14:20.240 --> 14:21.880
very painful now.

14:22.640 --> 14:23.920
If you choose your lover,

14:24.000 --> 14:25.720
the whole Moon Tribe will be destroyed.

14:25.800 --> 14:26.960
If you choose your tribe,

14:27.040 --> 14:29.080
your lover will die.

14:30.080 --> 14:32.240
This is the saddest thing

14:32.320 --> 14:33.880
in the world.

14:35.040 --> 14:36.000
But

14:36.560 --> 14:38.000
I can save her

14:38.080 --> 14:41.760
and teach you how to release
the 100,000 soldiers.

14:41.840 --> 14:43.960
As long as you cooperate with me,

14:44.040 --> 14:46.200
your tribe and your lover

14:46.280 --> 14:50.160
will no longer be an either-or choice.

15:03.240 --> 15:04.520
Did you have a nightmare again?

15:10.680 --> 15:11.800
Just now,

15:11.880 --> 15:13.480
I had a nightmare too.

15:13.560 --> 15:15.320
I dreamed of Lady Wanqing.

15:16.360 --> 15:17.320
In my dream,

15:17.400 --> 15:20.320
there were many people
who looked exactly like her.

15:20.400 --> 15:21.400
She also said

15:22.040 --> 15:24.240
the loss of my life is the gain of hers.

15:24.320 --> 15:26.840
If she comes back to life, I'll die.

15:27.360 --> 15:30.320
She said all the secrets were--

15:30.400 --> 15:32.160
It's just an ordinary dream.

15:32.240 --> 15:33.400
Don't take it too seriously.

15:34.000 --> 15:36.360
No. This dream is real.

15:36.440 --> 15:39.240
Do you want to hear about
the nightmare I just had?

15:46.560 --> 15:47.880
I just dreamed

15:49.840 --> 15:51.480
that you turned into

15:53.080 --> 15:54.120
a fat pig.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.400
We didn't have much time.

16:08.480 --> 16:10.760
The embroidery on the wedding dress
is not too delicate.

16:10.840 --> 16:12.360
What a pity.

16:12.440 --> 16:13.880
It's good enough.

16:13.960 --> 16:15.080
Thank you very much.

16:15.640 --> 16:16.640
Don't say that.

16:17.280 --> 16:19.000
By the way, starting tomorrow,

16:19.080 --> 16:20.640
you can't be called Fairy anymore.

16:20.720 --> 16:22.480
You should be called the Moon Queen.

16:24.320 --> 16:25.360
Fairy, have some tea.

16:26.200 --> 16:27.040
Leave it.

16:31.400 --> 16:32.240
Orchid.

16:33.320 --> 16:35.280
Lord Changheng, what are you doing here?

16:35.360 --> 16:36.320
I'm taking you home.

16:37.400 --> 16:38.880
My lord, please behave yourself.

16:39.760 --> 16:41.200
The Moon Supreme and I

16:41.280 --> 16:42.920
will get married tomorrow.

16:43.000 --> 16:45.000
Cangyan Sea is my home now.

16:45.720 --> 16:46.600
No.

16:47.800 --> 16:48.800
You are not marrying him.

16:49.840 --> 16:50.800
Lord Changheng.

16:51.480 --> 16:53.000
I've made myself clear

16:53.080 --> 16:54.760
at the riverside of the Oblivion River.

16:55.520 --> 16:56.520
That's not what I meant.

16:57.800 --> 16:58.720
Orchid.

16:58.800 --> 17:00.880
Don't you always want to know your origin

17:00.960 --> 17:02.520
and who you are?

17:03.120 --> 17:04.800
I finally know it now. Let me tell you.

17:04.880 --> 17:05.880
I don't want to know.

17:06.480 --> 17:09.040
I appreciate your kindness.

17:10.000 --> 17:11.040
It doesn't matter

17:11.640 --> 17:12.960
who I was before.

17:13.599 --> 17:14.760
I only know

17:14.839 --> 17:17.240
I'll be Dongfang Qingcang's wife

17:17.319 --> 17:19.200
and the Moon Queen of Cangyan Sea.

17:20.079 --> 17:21.200
Now,

17:21.280 --> 17:23.319
the war between the Moon and Fairy Tribes.

17:23.880 --> 17:25.160
You should go back now.

17:25.920 --> 17:26.960
It's inappropriate

17:27.720 --> 17:30.320
for you and me to meet.

17:36.480 --> 17:37.320
Follow me.

17:38.000 --> 17:39.000
What are you doing?

17:39.080 --> 17:40.080
Lord Changheng.

17:48.280 --> 17:50.200
Lord Changheng, let go of me!

17:50.960 --> 17:52.280
Where are you taking me?

17:53.280 --> 17:55.960
- Lord Changheng, let go of me!
- Orchid, calm down!

18:03.640 --> 18:04.560
Where am I?

18:04.640 --> 18:06.280
This is the ruin of the Xilan Tribe

18:06.360 --> 18:07.440
after it was destroyed.

18:09.320 --> 18:11.200
Everyone that has learned history knows

18:11.280 --> 18:12.960
that during the war 30,000 years ago,

18:13.480 --> 18:15.960
the Xilan Tribe
was killed by the Moon Tribe.

18:17.200 --> 18:18.200
This ruin

18:19.280 --> 18:21.640
is soaked with the blood
of the Xilan people.

18:26.120 --> 18:26.960
Orchid.

18:28.640 --> 18:29.480
Your name

18:31.040 --> 18:31.920
is Xiyun.

18:32.560 --> 18:33.680
Your real identity

18:34.680 --> 18:35.840
is the Goddess of Xishan.

18:36.840 --> 18:38.080
The Moon Tribe is your enemy.

18:38.680 --> 18:40.040
Your parents and your people

18:40.120 --> 18:41.640
were all killed by them.

19:01.800 --> 19:02.680
But…

19:03.400 --> 19:04.600
I don't know them.

19:09.080 --> 19:10.000
What did you say?

19:12.360 --> 19:13.520
I said

19:13.600 --> 19:15.920
I don't know these Xilan people.

19:19.960 --> 19:20.880
Just now,

19:21.520 --> 19:24.280
I tried hard to feel the sadness
of this land.

19:25.480 --> 19:26.720
But I've only felt

19:27.640 --> 19:30.160
this sadness in another place.

19:47.040 --> 19:48.200
That's how war is.

19:49.040 --> 19:50.080
Many people die

19:50.720 --> 19:51.920
because of war.

19:52.480 --> 19:54.600
The extermination of a tribe
keeps happening.

19:55.320 --> 19:57.040
The hatred will never stop.

19:57.720 --> 19:58.920
But the pain

19:59.000 --> 20:01.760
only goes to those who want to live.

20:01.840 --> 20:03.640
Orchid, why don't you understand?

20:04.640 --> 20:05.880
Although you don't know

20:05.960 --> 20:08.000
or remember your parents and your people,

20:08.080 --> 20:10.280
they died
because they wanted to protect you.

20:10.840 --> 20:12.040
Lord Changheng.

20:12.120 --> 20:14.680
I am Orchid, not the Goddess of Xishan.

20:15.840 --> 20:17.800
It's like when you were in Lucheng.

20:18.320 --> 20:20.400
You were Xiao Run, not Changheng.

20:20.920 --> 20:23.560
Xiao Run doesn't need to bear
the burden of Changheng

20:23.640 --> 20:25.560
because they are not the same person.

20:37.160 --> 20:38.240
In this world,

20:38.920 --> 20:40.160
what is real

20:40.720 --> 20:41.880
and what is fake?

20:43.000 --> 20:44.560
I only know

20:46.600 --> 20:47.960
I love Dongfang Qingcang.

20:48.720 --> 20:49.600
It's real.

20:51.240 --> 20:52.120
He loves me.

20:52.920 --> 20:54.040
It's also real.

20:55.160 --> 20:56.440
It's more real than anything.

20:58.320 --> 20:59.240
That's enough.

20:59.880 --> 21:01.080
But…

21:07.480 --> 21:08.360
Old friend.

21:09.040 --> 21:10.520
We meet again.

21:11.120 --> 21:12.400
God Xuanwu.

21:13.520 --> 21:14.880
It seems that

21:14.960 --> 21:17.240
you already know your name.

21:18.320 --> 21:19.480
Am I really

21:19.560 --> 21:21.280
the Goddess, Xiyun?

21:39.640 --> 21:41.240
Tomorrow's wedding

21:41.800 --> 21:43.640
is not your destiny.

21:43.720 --> 21:44.720
Why?

21:45.280 --> 21:47.160
You are the Goddess of Xishan.

21:47.880 --> 21:50.200
Your love is selfless and inclusive.

21:50.680 --> 21:53.520
You are destined
to take your responsibility.

21:53.600 --> 21:57.480
You are destined to cease hatred
and protect the people.

21:57.560 --> 21:59.480
Why? I don't understand.

21:59.560 --> 22:01.920
Cease hatred and protect the people?

22:02.000 --> 22:04.360
What does it have to do with
being Dongfang Qingcang's wife?

22:04.440 --> 22:07.000
Why can't I love someone
and the people at the same time?

22:07.080 --> 22:09.200
Why must you force me to make a choice?

22:09.280 --> 22:10.360
I'm not convinced.

22:10.440 --> 22:11.440
Old friend.

22:12.120 --> 22:13.920
You came too early.

22:14.880 --> 22:17.160
You haven't seen
what you are supposed to see.

22:17.680 --> 22:19.200
You haven't lost

22:19.280 --> 22:21.000
what you are supposed to lose.

22:22.120 --> 22:23.280
Leave.

22:24.000 --> 22:26.280
We'll meet again.

22:39.520 --> 22:41.240
Did you meet God Xuanwu?

22:41.320 --> 22:42.520
Have you changed your mind?

22:44.640 --> 22:46.640
I won't follow the so-called destiny

22:46.720 --> 22:47.880
or fate.

22:48.440 --> 22:50.840
I am Orchid, not Goddess Xiyun.

22:50.920 --> 22:51.880
I need to find him.

22:54.320 --> 22:56.120
There's a gap in military strength.

22:56.720 --> 22:58.480
Dongfang Qingcang has no Hellfire now.

22:58.560 --> 23:00.240
The Moon Tribe
will eventually be defeated.

23:01.440 --> 23:03.920
You will be in danger
if you go back now, Orchid.

23:06.520 --> 23:08.080
I can't let you go back.

23:08.640 --> 23:09.800
Lord Changheng.

23:12.840 --> 23:14.640
Are you really going to stop me?

23:20.240 --> 23:21.360
My lord.

23:22.120 --> 23:23.240
You are the God of War.

23:24.280 --> 23:26.560
I am just a grass
whose immortal root has been broken.

23:26.640 --> 23:28.480
If you insist on stopping me,

23:29.320 --> 23:30.720
there's nothing I can do.

23:30.800 --> 23:32.600
But I will never give in.

23:34.240 --> 23:36.440
Just like that day
at the riverside of Oblivion River.

23:38.440 --> 23:41.040
Even if I were to be killed by thousands
of Spirit-Vanishing Arrows,

23:42.320 --> 23:43.760
I would never turn back.

23:53.040 --> 23:54.280
Thank you, my lord.

23:58.840 --> 24:01.320
That day, Dongfang Qingcang
saw what Danyin saw too.

24:02.000 --> 24:03.720
He knows you're Goddess Xiyun.

24:04.280 --> 24:05.600
But he didn't tell you anything.

24:07.040 --> 24:09.000
If he really loves you,
why would he hide it?

24:10.640 --> 24:11.800
You said he truly loves you.

24:12.600 --> 24:13.880
It's more real than anything.

24:13.960 --> 24:15.720
Why did he put you in danger?

24:17.040 --> 24:17.960
Orchid!

24:39.440 --> 24:40.960
My lord.

24:42.040 --> 24:42.960
I know it.

24:43.960 --> 24:45.920
My lord, Orchid was taken away
by Changheng.

24:46.000 --> 24:47.600
Why aren't you worried?

24:48.160 --> 24:49.160
She will come back.

24:50.360 --> 24:52.440
Will Changheng allow her to come back?

24:54.480 --> 24:55.480
Yes.

24:59.440 --> 25:00.880
Because I know them well.

25:03.320 --> 25:04.320
One

25:06.160 --> 25:08.000
was my best friend.

25:08.680 --> 25:09.720
The other

25:12.840 --> 25:14.720
was the woman I wanted to marry.

25:39.600 --> 25:40.600
After tomorrow,

25:41.800 --> 25:44.160
you will be the sinner
who destroys the Moon Tribe.

25:46.640 --> 25:48.200
And I didn't stop you.

25:50.160 --> 25:51.600
I am a sinner too.

25:53.440 --> 25:56.120
But you don't care, do you?

25:57.680 --> 25:59.760
As long as you can spend time with her…

25:59.840 --> 26:01.720
I've decided to sacrifice her.

26:12.440 --> 26:13.480
Big Blockhead.

26:15.200 --> 26:16.040
Big Blockhead.

26:17.960 --> 26:19.160
Where are you?

26:33.160 --> 26:34.560
What are you doing?

26:39.920 --> 26:41.400
Take her down!

26:41.480 --> 26:43.360
- Go.
- Let go of me!

26:43.440 --> 26:46.240
Let go of me!

26:46.320 --> 26:47.720
Xunfeng, let go of me!

26:53.880 --> 26:56.000
Let go of me!

26:59.640 --> 27:02.200
Xunfeng, I know you don't like me.

27:02.280 --> 27:03.880
But how dare you do this to me?

27:03.960 --> 27:06.480
- Aren't you afraid Moon Supreme will…
- You're wrong.

27:07.720 --> 27:10.120
I respect you very much.

27:13.280 --> 27:14.760
Then why did you do this?

27:14.840 --> 27:17.320
Now, the war is coming.

27:17.400 --> 27:19.480
The lord is worried about the war.

27:19.560 --> 27:21.240
You are not helping him,

27:21.320 --> 27:22.840
but picking on me here.

27:22.920 --> 27:24.080
Why?

27:24.160 --> 27:25.280
You're wrong again.

27:27.160 --> 27:29.560
I was ordered to imprison you

27:30.160 --> 27:32.160
to help my brother.

27:33.360 --> 27:34.200
You're crazy.

27:35.120 --> 27:36.280
I want to see him.

27:39.360 --> 27:40.920
My brother won't see you.

27:47.560 --> 27:48.440
Keep an eye on her.

27:48.520 --> 27:49.440
- Yes.
- Yes.

27:50.720 --> 27:52.080
Xunfeng, what are you doing?

27:52.160 --> 27:53.640
Let me out!

27:53.720 --> 27:54.960
Xunfeng!

27:56.040 --> 27:58.440
Dongfang Qingcang!

28:10.840 --> 28:11.880
My lord.

28:11.960 --> 28:14.680
Didn't you stop marching around
and getting involved in wars?

28:15.320 --> 28:17.640
Why did you get the armor back?

28:22.840 --> 28:23.880
Where is Orchid?

28:24.600 --> 28:25.720
Don't worry.

28:26.320 --> 28:29.200
She's recuperating
in the Silent Moon Palace.

28:30.680 --> 28:32.120
When the war starts,

28:33.720 --> 28:35.840
she will sacrifice her life.

28:36.840 --> 28:38.400
If you want to start the war now,

28:38.960 --> 28:41.240
I will fight to the end.

28:44.160 --> 28:46.160
Since the war is inevitable,

28:47.120 --> 28:48.480
I will lead the fairy army

28:49.040 --> 28:50.520
to bring back the Goddess of Xishan.

28:50.600 --> 28:52.480
So whether you want to or not,

28:53.160 --> 28:54.280
this war

28:54.840 --> 28:55.960
will happen.

28:56.680 --> 28:57.560
And you

28:58.160 --> 28:59.160
will definitely join in.

29:02.360 --> 29:03.680
And you're destined to fight.

29:04.160 --> 29:05.800
Because we are both the same.

29:06.320 --> 29:07.400
I have no choice.

29:08.360 --> 29:09.760
In the end, you have no choice either.

29:31.200 --> 29:33.280
The weather is usually fine here.

29:33.920 --> 29:36.320
Now, it's quite interesting.

29:40.200 --> 29:41.240
It's just lightning.

29:41.320 --> 29:43.000
I'm not afraid.

29:55.000 --> 29:57.720
The food is so greasy.

29:58.320 --> 30:00.600
I hate all of them.

30:01.800 --> 30:04.320
Xunfeng has gone too far.

30:08.800 --> 30:10.960
He remembers
what I hate to eat so clearly.

30:11.600 --> 30:15.160
Is the food ordered by Dongfang Qingcang?

30:15.240 --> 30:16.760
He knows I'm locked up here.

30:17.480 --> 30:19.120
Why didn't he come to save me?

30:20.320 --> 30:21.520
I know it.

30:21.600 --> 30:24.600
He must have his own difficulties,
so he has to convey his message secretly.

30:24.680 --> 30:25.840
Luckily, I'm smart.

30:28.720 --> 30:31.200
Is there any hidden message in the food?

30:47.760 --> 30:49.280
There is none.

30:50.280 --> 30:51.960
But given his personality,

30:52.040 --> 30:54.160
I don't think
he will make things implicit.

30:55.200 --> 30:56.400
It doesn't make sense.

31:08.160 --> 31:09.080
Big Blockhead.

31:10.960 --> 31:13.680
Don't try to fool me this time.

31:14.680 --> 31:16.720
You have to give me a good reason

31:17.320 --> 31:18.840
so that I will consider

31:19.600 --> 31:21.360
forgiving you.

31:22.520 --> 31:23.600
- Open it.
- Yes.

31:26.320 --> 31:27.360
What's that sound?

31:27.840 --> 31:29.120
Big Blockhead is here.

31:35.920 --> 31:36.760
Stop!

31:36.840 --> 31:37.960
I'm telling you to stop!

31:39.600 --> 31:41.240
Xunfeng, are you crazy?

31:42.080 --> 31:43.960
You keep bullying me with false orders.

31:44.040 --> 31:45.840
Aren't you afraid
Moon Supreme will get angry?

31:46.840 --> 31:48.040
My brother said

31:48.760 --> 31:50.160
you don't need these flowers here.

31:50.240 --> 31:53.240
You don't need to make the Phoenix Crown.

31:53.320 --> 31:55.040
- How did you…
- That's right.

31:55.720 --> 31:58.720
You are wondering how I know what you
and my brother have said privately.

31:59.720 --> 32:01.400
Of course he told me himself.

32:02.640 --> 32:04.280
He also asked me

32:04.960 --> 32:06.240
to remove these flowers.

32:08.160 --> 32:09.440
That's impossible.

32:09.520 --> 32:10.440
I don't believe it.

32:17.000 --> 32:18.960
I heard that you didn't sleep well
these days,

32:19.040 --> 32:21.320
so I prepared this just for you.

32:21.400 --> 32:23.400
But this is not any ordinary orchid.

32:23.480 --> 32:25.520
I made it with my primordial spirit.

32:26.880 --> 32:28.200
Add this in.

32:28.920 --> 32:30.320
Is it enough?

32:43.760 --> 32:46.040
This is the ancient Chengying Sword.

32:47.440 --> 32:48.960
Only by killing you with it

32:49.960 --> 32:52.040
can the One Heart Curse be broken.

32:52.720 --> 32:55.720
This sword was broken into
countless pieces.

32:56.480 --> 32:57.920
Every fragment of the sword

32:58.640 --> 33:01.320
was found by my brother

33:01.400 --> 33:03.280
from the three realms.

33:03.760 --> 33:06.200
When the war between
the Moon Tribe and fairies starts,

33:07.280 --> 33:09.880
my brother will kill you

33:10.560 --> 33:13.120
with this sword.

33:22.840 --> 33:23.840
Let's go.

34:00.040 --> 34:01.080
Jieli.

34:05.720 --> 34:07.760
Jieli, what's going on?

34:07.840 --> 34:09.199
I also want to ask you.

34:09.280 --> 34:11.800
Why did the lord lock you up
out of the blue?

34:12.320 --> 34:14.080
The palace is also heavily guarded.

34:14.159 --> 34:15.239
It's so frightening.

34:16.920 --> 34:18.800
Is it really his order?

34:25.199 --> 34:26.320
Orchid.

34:27.080 --> 34:27.920
Don't be sad.

34:30.639 --> 34:32.320
Where is he? I want to see him.

34:34.159 --> 34:35.120
No.

34:36.000 --> 34:37.520
I sneaked into the palace to visit you.

34:37.600 --> 34:39.199
It's already risky.

34:39.840 --> 34:41.800
- If I let you out--
- Jieli.

34:42.520 --> 34:44.440
You've seen everything I've been through

34:44.520 --> 34:46.600
with Dongfang Qingcang.

34:47.400 --> 34:48.760
He promised me

34:48.840 --> 34:51.159
that no matter what happens,
we will face it together.

34:51.239 --> 34:52.960
I don't know what is happening now,

34:53.040 --> 34:55.159
but I know he must be
in a difficult situation.

34:55.239 --> 34:57.480
Take me to him. I'm begging you.

34:57.560 --> 34:58.560
But Orchid.

34:59.880 --> 35:01.200
The lord treated you like this.

35:02.560 --> 35:04.600
Does it mean he doesn't love you anymore?

35:06.040 --> 35:06.960
Impossible.

35:07.960 --> 35:08.880
Jieli.

35:08.960 --> 35:10.840
Take me to meet him.

35:14.560 --> 35:17.320
I'll give you three days' worth
of the Heart-Eroding Pill's antidote.

35:18.000 --> 35:19.000
After three days,

35:19.480 --> 35:21.440
if you haven't brought the goddess out,

35:22.160 --> 35:23.640
you and your man

35:23.720 --> 35:25.320
will succumb to the poison together.

35:25.400 --> 35:26.320
Moreover,

35:27.280 --> 35:29.160
he will die more painfully than you.

35:47.200 --> 35:48.040
Come.

35:53.320 --> 35:54.200
Jieli.

35:55.640 --> 35:56.640
What are you doing?

35:56.720 --> 35:58.240
Where are you taking her?

35:58.320 --> 35:59.200
Move.

35:59.280 --> 36:00.160
Jieli.

36:00.880 --> 36:02.360
I know you want to save her,

36:02.440 --> 36:04.160
but the lord has made his decision.

36:04.240 --> 36:05.720
You can't disobey his order, Jieli.

36:09.160 --> 36:10.800
Jieli, come back with me.

36:22.080 --> 36:23.280
Jieli.

36:23.360 --> 36:24.320
Jieli.

36:24.400 --> 36:25.320
Well done.

36:30.440 --> 36:31.520
People from Haishi.

36:34.040 --> 36:34.920
Jieli.

36:36.000 --> 36:37.360
They forced you, right?

36:40.320 --> 36:41.560
Don't be afraid.

36:41.640 --> 36:42.720
I'll protect you.

37:01.560 --> 37:02.640
Jieli!

37:02.720 --> 37:03.920
Where is his antidote?

37:04.920 --> 37:06.080
Hand her over first.

37:06.160 --> 37:07.520
I don't trust you.

37:07.600 --> 37:08.800
Give me the antidote first.

37:11.000 --> 37:12.080
You

37:12.960 --> 37:14.320
don't deserve to make conditions.

37:17.920 --> 37:18.920
Yes, I don't deserve to.

37:24.200 --> 37:25.880
But the Gold-Eroding Powder does.

37:26.440 --> 37:28.800
I stole it from Moon Supreme's
Spiritual Treasures Pavilion.

37:28.880 --> 37:29.960
Among the three realms,

37:30.640 --> 37:32.440
only this can break the Bone Orchid.

37:34.200 --> 37:35.480
You are asking for death.

37:35.560 --> 37:37.240
My life is cheap.

37:38.240 --> 37:40.360
I betrayed my lover and my friend.

37:40.440 --> 37:42.600
Where else can I stay
within the three realms?

37:42.680 --> 37:44.120
Do you think I'm afraid of death?

37:44.720 --> 37:46.600
I don't know why you need the Bone Orchid.

37:46.680 --> 37:48.600
But since you value it so much,

37:49.960 --> 37:52.120
I'll make sure you never get it.

37:52.200 --> 37:53.360
Stop!

38:24.800 --> 38:25.960
Sugar powder?

38:33.000 --> 38:34.480
How dare you lie to me?

38:35.520 --> 38:36.400
What?

38:38.920 --> 38:40.320
- She ran away?
- Yes.

38:40.400 --> 38:41.800
General Shangque has gone after her.

38:42.360 --> 38:43.800
Where is my brother now?

38:43.880 --> 38:45.320
The lord is in the training ground.

38:51.320 --> 38:52.280
Report!

38:52.360 --> 38:54.640
The Shuiyuntian Army is gathering
at the Oblivion River,

38:54.720 --> 38:56.760
the Northernmost Ocean,
and the border of the southern regions.

39:13.560 --> 39:14.400
Father.

39:15.480 --> 39:17.720
When Ninth You was about to collapse

39:17.800 --> 39:20.040
and you had to remove my emotions,

39:20.720 --> 39:22.280
did you feel the same way?

39:26.080 --> 39:28.240
The war between the Moon Tribe and fairies
is inevitable.

39:29.280 --> 39:30.520
For my people,

39:31.200 --> 39:32.960
do I have to sacrifice my beloved?

39:33.520 --> 39:35.080
Is there no other choice?

39:36.280 --> 39:37.640
I'm not convinced.

39:54.280 --> 39:55.480
I knew

39:55.560 --> 39:57.400
you would come to me again.

39:59.440 --> 40:01.680
Stop your tricks.

40:04.560 --> 40:06.800
Why do you think I showed up?

40:06.880 --> 40:09.960
It's because you have made your choice.

40:13.000 --> 40:14.480
Nonsense!

40:14.560 --> 40:16.240
Do you really think

40:16.320 --> 40:18.720
the evil qi only represents
massacre and hatred?

40:19.760 --> 40:21.400
I was born in ancient times.

40:21.480 --> 40:22.880
I am everywhere.

40:23.640 --> 40:26.320
I'm the darkest and most intense desire

40:26.400 --> 40:29.400
hidden in everyone's heart.

40:30.080 --> 40:33.360
Dongfang Qingcang,
you are the one who summoned me.

40:33.440 --> 40:34.400
Shut up.

40:35.000 --> 40:36.080
Shut up.

40:37.200 --> 40:39.680
You know it so clearly.

40:40.640 --> 40:42.920
Except for me, there is no other way

40:43.000 --> 40:45.600
to protect your lover and your people.

40:45.680 --> 40:48.960
Only I can give you the perfect solution

40:49.040 --> 40:50.760
so you don't have to choose.

40:50.840 --> 40:52.000
Only I

40:52.080 --> 40:55.160
am the cure for all your pain.

40:56.200 --> 40:57.240
Shut up!

41:09.800 --> 41:11.280
Dongfang Qingcang!

41:13.680 --> 41:14.920
What happened?

41:15.000 --> 41:16.320
I am really worried about you.

41:26.640 --> 41:27.840
Is this…

41:31.120 --> 41:32.480
the evil qi?

41:32.560 --> 41:33.600
That's right.

41:34.840 --> 41:37.760
The evil qi is the evilest thing
within the three realms.

41:38.320 --> 41:41.040
It matches my noble status.

41:41.120 --> 41:42.600
It can help me restore

41:42.680 --> 41:44.520
my army of 100,000.

41:44.600 --> 41:45.840
Moon Supreme, please don't.

41:46.800 --> 41:48.280
The evil qi is extremely vicious.

41:48.360 --> 41:49.640
If something goes wrong,

41:49.720 --> 41:50.960
it will invade the soul.

41:51.040 --> 41:53.040
Only cowards will fear sharp blades.

41:53.120 --> 41:54.720
My body is intact

41:54.800 --> 41:56.400
and my primordial spirit won't vanish.

41:56.480 --> 41:58.080
Controlling the evil qi

41:58.160 --> 42:00.360
is easy for me.

42:00.440 --> 42:01.560
No one can stop me.

42:03.480 --> 42:04.600
Impossible.

42:07.280 --> 42:08.440
Impossible.

42:10.320 --> 42:12.800
The evil qi killed
so many innocent people.

42:13.800 --> 42:15.160
You saw it with your own eyes.

42:17.320 --> 42:20.280
You even cleansed the primordial spirits
that couldn't rest in peace.

42:22.080 --> 42:23.800
You care about the people.

42:24.520 --> 42:26.200
And you are kind and merciful.

42:26.280 --> 42:27.360
Why would you…

42:33.760 --> 42:35.280
Kind and merciful?

42:36.160 --> 42:37.160
Ridiculous.

42:38.920 --> 42:41.760
I am the supreme lord
within the three realms.

42:42.440 --> 42:45.360
What? Because of the One Heart Curse,

42:45.440 --> 42:47.640
our lives are codependent.

42:47.720 --> 42:49.920
So I have to pretend to be nice to you.

42:50.720 --> 42:51.960
Did you take it seriously?

42:52.880 --> 42:53.760
That's not true.

42:55.120 --> 42:56.440
You told me

42:57.200 --> 42:58.960
the same lie before.

43:00.120 --> 43:01.840
I won't trust you again.

43:02.680 --> 43:04.440
You're not that kind of person.

43:08.560 --> 43:10.520
Changheng took you away

43:10.600 --> 43:13.480
to tell you your real identity, right?

43:20.800 --> 43:23.280
I knew you were the Goddess of Xishan
long ago.

43:24.640 --> 43:26.000
I pretended to be nice to you

43:26.080 --> 43:28.200
to take advantage of your power

43:28.800 --> 43:31.680
and recuperate the primordial spirit
of Lady Chidi in the Bone Orchid.

43:32.480 --> 43:34.040
When her primordial spirit is complete,

43:34.680 --> 43:36.360
you will die.

43:37.440 --> 43:38.800
From the very beginning,

43:38.880 --> 43:41.120
I have planned everything.

43:41.840 --> 43:44.400
You thought I gave you the Bone Orchid
because I liked you?

43:45.320 --> 43:46.240
Foolish.

43:47.840 --> 43:50.000
The Bone Orchid will consume your life

43:50.560 --> 43:52.440
until you die.

43:57.240 --> 43:58.120
Remember,

43:58.200 --> 44:00.720
the loss of your life is the gain of mine.

44:01.520 --> 44:02.800
If I can come back to life,

44:02.880 --> 44:03.920
you will die.

44:04.800 --> 44:06.400
All the secrets are in…

44:07.800 --> 44:09.120
Lady Wanqing.

44:09.200 --> 44:10.480
Lady Wanqing!

44:15.560 --> 44:16.560
I don't believe it.

44:19.960 --> 44:21.040
In the Fairy Realm,

44:22.520 --> 44:23.360
Lucheng,

44:24.120 --> 44:25.160
and the Oblivion River,

44:27.000 --> 44:29.320
you have risked your life
to save me so many times.

44:30.000 --> 44:32.520
We have gone through
so many tough times together.

44:36.000 --> 44:37.320
Do you remember

44:38.760 --> 44:41.960
you promised me
that you would never lie to me?

44:43.080 --> 44:45.200
You promised me
that no matter what happens,

44:45.280 --> 44:47.240
we will face it together.

44:48.920 --> 44:50.200
Why now…

44:50.280 --> 44:53.040
Your Xilan Tribe was destroyed by me.

44:54.000 --> 44:57.480
It doesn't matter to kill one more.

44:57.560 --> 44:58.880
You're lying!

45:00.560 --> 45:03.440
Do you dare to turn around and tell me

45:04.440 --> 45:06.120
you've never loved me?
